# olcli push/sync ignore list (gitignore syntax; see .claude/skills/overleaf).
#
# data/ and the figure-regeneration uv project are repo-side reproducibility scaffolding
# (aggregate JSON symlinks, python sources, lockfile) — none of it belongs in the Overleaf
# project. The rendered figures/out/*.pdf DO belong there (the .tex \includegraphics's
# them via \graphicspath{{figures/out/}}), but `olcli push` skips PDFs regardless, so
# they are synced explicitly instead:
#   olcli upload figures/out/<name>.pdf --to figures/out/<name>.pdf
# Run that after `uv run figures` whenever a committed figure PDF changes.
data/
figures/.venv/
figures/__pycache__/
figures/src/
figures/out/*.pgf
figures/pyproject.toml
figures/uv.lock
figures/README.md
figures/.gitignore
